; digest is SHA-256 over the complete DER SubjectPublicKeyInfo:
;   3059301306072a8648ce3d020106082a8648ce3d03010703420004 || X || Y
;
; AUTH_P256_SYNTHETIC_PIN selects the deterministic private-key-backed fixture
; from tls13-spike/auth_integrated_oracle.py.  It exists only so Unicorn can
; execute a known-valid CertificateVerify equation.  Production assembly omits
; that fixture point entirely.
;
; AUTH_P256_LIVE_202607_PIN selects the dated, credential-free live leaf
; captured by issuer_auth_live_vector.json.  The leaf was independently
; checked under WE1, for api.openai.com, serverAuth, key usage, and its
; 2026-07-08..2026-10-06 validity interval by issuer_auth_check.py.  This
; exact-leaf pin is deliberately a live-integration checkpoint, not the
; durable issuer-anchor policy.

